{"id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","title":"Effective Program Coding","display":"df-effective-program-coding — Effective Program Coding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-effective-program-coding","aliases":["58-df-effective-program-coding"],"display":"df-effective-program-coding — Effective Program Coding","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-effective-program-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-effective-program-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-program-coding — Effective Program Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3dd0e6836d447ca6\" href=\"?note=3dd0e6836d447ca6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,e,x,y,n,t,i,j,k\\in\\omega\">\\(a,b,c,e,x,y,n,t,i,j,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,P,r,C,u,v\">\\(s,P,r,C,u,v\\)</span> 为集合编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^n\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^n\\)</span>；有限序列的拼接与限制采用本书的函数图编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqDecode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqDecode}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProgramCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProgramCode}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e\">\\(\\Phi_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\">\\(\\Phi_e^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 为下式定义的函数或函数图；此编号在全书中固定，不在各次调用时重新选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterStep}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegisterStep}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}\\)</span> 为下式定义的谓词。状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,r\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,r\\rangle\\)</span> 的第一分量为指令地址；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(0)\">\\(r(0)\\)</span> 为输入与输出寄存器。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span> 的计算记号仅使用下式给出的图成员缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3dd0e6836d447ca6\" href=\"?note=3dd0e6836d447ca6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\qquad(a,b\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\qquad(a,b\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)=c\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(s\\in\\omega^n\\land h(0)=0\\land c=h(n)\\land\n\\forall j\\in n\\;h(j+1)=1+\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(h(j),s(j))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)=c\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists h\\in\\omega^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(s\\in\\omega^n\\land h(0)=0\\land c=h(n)\\land\n\\forall j\\in n\\;h(j+1)=1+\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(h(j),s(j))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall c\\in\\omega\\;\\exists!s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)=c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall c\\in\\omega\\;\\exists!s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)=c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqDecode}_{58}(c)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)=c)\\qquad(c\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SeqDecode}_{58}(c)\\coloneqq\\iota s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s)=c)\\qquad(c\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}(r)\\leftrightarrow r\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\exists b\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(b\\leq i\\to r(i)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}(r)\\leftrightarrow r\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\exists b\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(b\\leq i\\to r(i)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}(P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(P\\in(\\omega^4)^n\\land\n\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(P(i)(0)\\in4\\land\\bigl(P(i)(0)\\in\\{1,3\\}\\to P(i)(2)\\in n\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(P(i)(0)=2\\to P(i)(2),P(i)(3)\\in n\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}(P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(P\\in(\\omega^4)^n\\land\n\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(P(i)(0)\\in4\\land\\bigl(P(i)(0)\\in\\{1,3\\}\\to P(i)(2)\\in n\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(P(i)(0)=2\\to P(i)(2),P(i)(3)\\in n\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProgramCode}_{58}(P)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(P(i))\\mid i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\qquad\\bigl(P\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\omega^4)^n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProgramCode}_{58}(P)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\\bigl(\\langle\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(P(i))\\mid i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\qquad\\bigl(P\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\omega^4)^n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegisterStep}_{58}(v,u,P,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}(P)\\land\n\\exists i,i&#39;,r,r&#39;,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\langle i,r\\rangle\\land v=\\langle i&#39;,r&#39;\\rangle\\land i,i&#39;\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\land\n\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}(r)\\land\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}(r&#39;)\\land a,b,c\\in\\omega\\land\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(P(i)=\\langle1,a,b,c\\rangle\\land i&#39;=b\\land r&#39;(a)=r(a)+1\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{a\\}\\;r&#39;(j)=r(j)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(P(i)=\\langle2,a,b,c\\rangle\\land\n((r(a)=0\\land i&#39;=b\\land r&#39;=r)\\lor\n(0&lt;r(a)\\land i&#39;=c\\land r&#39;(a)+1=r(a)\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{a\\}\\;r&#39;(j)=r(j)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(P(i)=\\langle3,a,b,c\\rangle\\land i&#39;=b\\land r&#39;(a)\\in2\\land(r&#39;(a)=1\\leftrightarrow r(a)\\in A)\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{a\\}\\;r&#39;(j)=r(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegisterStep}_{58}(v,u,P,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}(P)\\land\n\\exists i,i&#39;,r,r&#39;,a,b,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\langle i,r\\rangle\\land v=\\langle i&#39;,r&#39;\\rangle\\land i,i&#39;\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\land\n\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}(r)\\land\\mathrm{RegisterState}_{58}(r&#39;)\\land a,b,c\\in\\omega\\land\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(P(i)=\\langle1,a,b,c\\rangle\\land i&#39;=b\\land r&#39;(a)=r(a)+1\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{a\\}\\;r&#39;(j)=r(j)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(P(i)=\\langle2,a,b,c\\rangle\\land\n((r(a)=0\\land i&#39;=b\\land r&#39;=r)\\lor\n(0&lt;r(a)\\land i&#39;=c\\land r&#39;(a)+1=r(a)\\land\\forall j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{a\\}\\;r&#39;(j)=r(j)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(P(i)=\\langle3,a,b,c\\rangle\\land i&#39;=b\\land r&#39;(a)\\in2\\land(r&#39;(a)=1\\leftrightarrow r(a)\\in A)\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{a\\}\\;r&#39;(j)=r(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,A,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\ne,x,y\\in\\omega\\land A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in V\\;\\exists i,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}(P)\\land\\operatorname{ProgramCode}_{58}(P)=e\n\\land C\\in\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\times\\omega^\\omega\\bigr)^{t+1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land C(0)=\\left\\langle0,\\{\\langle0,x\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\right\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in t\\;\\mathrm{RegisterStep}_{58}(C(j+1),C(j),P,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land C(t)=\\langle i,r\\rangle\\land i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\land P(i)(0)=0\\land r(0)=y\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,A,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\ne,x,y\\in\\omega\\land A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists t\\in\\omega\\;\\exists C\\in V\\;\\exists i,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RegisterProgram}_{58}(P)\\land\\operatorname{ProgramCode}_{58}(P)=e\n\\land C\\in\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\times\\omega^\\omega\\bigr)^{t+1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land C(0)=\\left\\langle0,\\{\\langle0,x\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle j,0\\rangle:j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\right\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in t\\;\\mathrm{RegisterStep}_{58}(C(j+1),C(j),P,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land C(t)=\\langle i,r\\rangle\\land i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(P)\\land P(i)(0)=0\\land r(0)=y\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega:\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,A,x)\\}\n\\qquad(e\\in\\omega\\land A\\subseteq\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_e^A\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega:\\mathrm{RegisterEvaluation}_{58}(y,e,A,x)\\}\n\\qquad(e\\in\\omega\\land A\\subseteq\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\Phi_e^\\varnothing,\\qquad\\Phi_e\\coloneqq\\varphi_e,\\qquad W_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\qquad(e\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\Phi_e^\\varnothing,\\qquad\\Phi_e\\coloneqq\\varphi_e,\\qquad W_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\qquad(e\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq y\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e,\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e^A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq y\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e,\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e^A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e^A,\n\\qquad\\bigl(\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\;\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e^A,\n\\qquad\\bigl(\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall c\\in\\omega\\;\\exists!\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)=c\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall c\\in\\omega\\;\\exists!\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)=c\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairLeft}_{58}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\iota a\\in\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)=c\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PairLeft}_{58}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\iota a\\in\\omega\\;\\exists b\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)=c\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairRight}_{58}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\iota b\\in\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)=c\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PairRight}_{58}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\iota b\\in\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)=c\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\Phi_e^A,\\omega,\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\Phi_e^A,\\omega,\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BaireOracleCode}_{58}(p)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,p(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(p\\in\\omega^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BaireOracleCode}_{58}(p)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,p(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\qquad(p\\in\\omega^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^p\\coloneqq\\Phi_e^{\\operatorname{BaireOracleCode}_{58}(p)}\n\\qquad(e\\in\\omega\\land p\\in\\omega^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e^p\\coloneqq\\Phi_e^{\\operatorname{BaireOracleCode}_{58}(p)}\n\\qquad(e\\in\\omega\\land p\\in\\omega^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\varphi_e^p(n)\\downarrow=y\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^p.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\varphi_e^p(n)\\downarrow=y\\bigr)\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle n,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^p.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>新增此文件只为补足原有计算性文件依赖而未提供的有效编号及执行语义。程序只使用停机、增一、带零测试的减一和预言查询；有限执行见证唯一决定输出。</li>\n<li>非程序编号没有成功执行，故对应空图；不会把“编号有效”或“所有有限规则相容”作为不可判定的附加停机条件。</li>\n<li>序列、指令和自然数编号分别编码；集合论有序对不会被直接当作自然数程序输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dd0e6836d447ca6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dd0e6836d447ca6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 取 [[../batch16/58-df-partial-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,c,e,x,y,n,t,i,j,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s,P,r,C,u,v","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}","display":false},